{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55360","headline":"瀑布 · 江爲","name":"瀑布","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庐山正南面，瀑布古来闻。\n万里朝沧海，千寻出白云。\n寒声终自远，灵派孰爲分。\n除却天台後，平流莫可羣。\n（录自《吉石盦丛书》本宋陈舜俞《庐山记》卷四。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"江爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}